void insert_before(Node *p, int D) {
    Node *q = malloc(sizeof(Node));
    q->data = p->data;   /* new node gets p's old data */
    q->next = p->next;   /* splice q in right after p  */
    p->next = q;
    p->data = D;         /* p now holds D              */
}
```
List before: $\ldots \to [x] \to \ldots$ (where $p$ holds $x$). After: $\ldots \to [D] \to [x] \to \ldots$ — D is right before $x$.
